  "method": "One ranking revision 4 screen per photo (pinned model, CPU), read three ways from the same window similarities: whole frame only, tiles only, and both (what runs use). Each arm ranks photos by best margin; a reviewer budget K is the top K photos. The incidental queue is measured against independent labels (evaluation-eligible reference-collection examples and agreeing blind audits, both on the rank-independent blind audit sample only); a pooled queue of incidental, reference and lookalike photos is measured against source subject labels and counts lookalikes reaching the budget as the weed they resemble. Lookalikes are screened without a subject prompt, as in #11; pilot photos with it, as in a run.",
